      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Leg and hip servo motors that actively assist the wearer's walking and running gait, effectively carrying a portion of the suit's weight and adding mechanical thrust to each stride. Originally developed for heavy-labor hardsuit use in low-gravity environments, the combat adaptation provides a meaningful increase in ground speed during tactical movement. Increases your Speed by 5 feet.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> - Install in armor during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure.</p><hr/><p><em>Installation: Drag it onto armor in your inventory to install it. Its bonus applies while the armor it is installed in is worn. </em></p>"
